 Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;line-height:107%;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">We are pleased to inform you of the 2026 Spring\nSemester Graduate School Admission Guidelines for International students.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;line-height:107%;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;line-height:107%;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans;\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\">Please see the attached for\nfurther information and if there are any candidates interested in this program,\nplease <u>fill out online application through school webpage</u> and send me <u>one\noriginal application document by post</u> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-weight:\nbold\">no later than <u>December 17<sup>th</sup> (Wednesday) 2025, 5 pm</u></span><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">.<o:p></o:p></span></u></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\">*Online application is\navailable only during the application period, which is from November 17<sup>th</sup>\n(10 am) till December 17<sup>th</sup> (5 pm), 2025.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:\nitalic\">All required documents must be written either in English or Korean by\ncomputer typing.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:\nitalic\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;\nmso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">For further information, please see attached or\nvisit school website (</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/\"><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n바탕체;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">www.kumoh.ac.kr</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:바탕체;color:black;ms